[Tournament Analysis on payload variants]
  vertices: q, sum, product, denpow, numpow
  risk observable: row-bank pairwise order agreement
  locality observable: inverse Farey-order inversion count
  tie Hamiltonian path: q -> sum -> product -> denpow -> numpow
